BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Homecoming Black & White Ball– 2 DJs\, 2 Rooms\, Live Entertainm
 ent\, Crowns!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T013000
UID:261105_8O_67KCjUKYH1PZ8iYibA
DESCRIPTION:HOMECOMING: THE BLACK & WHITE BALL\n\nSaturday\, November 7 | 
 7 PM | Barrel Proof Lounge\n\nWho says you can't go back to Homecoming? Th
 is time\, we're doing it right.\n\nDust off that suit. Find a dress that d
 eserves a night out. Grab your date\, your friends\, or your favorite trou
 blemakers. We're throwing a Homecoming Ball for grown-ups\, and you're inv
 ited.\n\nOn Saturday\, November 7\, Barrel Proof Lounge transforms into a 
 black-and-white celebration of music\, dancing\, live entertainment\, and 
 a little royal mischief.\n\nTwo rooms. Two DJs. Live performances. One spe
 ctacular Saturday night.\n\nAnd yes\, we're crowning a Homecoming King & Q
 ueen!\n\nTWO ROOMS. TWO DIFFERENT PARTIES.\n\nTHE MAIN ROOM — DRUM & BAS
 S / EDM\n\nStep into the electronic side of Homecoming. Drum & bass\, elec
 tronic grooves\, and an immersive dance floor with a little underground ni
 ghtclub energy. A different kind of school dance\, and one you won't want 
 to miss.\n\nTHE LOUNGE — 90s & 2000s DANCE HITS\n\nRemember the songs th
 at filled the dance floor at your actual school dances? We're bringing the
 m back!\n\nFrom 90s dance anthems to the biggest club hits of the 2000s\, 
 The Lounge is serving up two decades of nostalgia\, guilty pleasures\, and
  songs you still know every word to.\n\nYour old-school Homecoming soundtr
 ack\, with a grown-up twist.\n\nMove between both rooms and find your kind
  of fun.\n\nWHO WILL BE CROWNED HOMECOMING ROYALTY?\n\nWe're bringing back
  one of Homecoming's greatest traditions!\n\nThroughout the evening\, we'l
 l be celebrating our guests and selecting a Homecoming King & Queen\, comp
 lete with prizes and bragging rights.\n\nSo dress to impress! Black and wh
 ite is the theme\, but how you interpret it is entirely up to you.\n\nEleg
 ant? Absolutely.\n\nOutrageous? Even better.\n\nPUNCH\, POPCORN & A LITTLE
  SOMETHING TO EAT\n\nWhat's Homecoming without punch?\n\nWe'll have punch\
 , popcorn\, and delicious appetizers from our neighbors at Capriciano Oste
 ria\, right next door.\n\nPlus\, the Barrel Proof bar will be serving up b
 eer\, wine\, bubbles\, Soju cocktails\, and plenty of other reasons to rai
 se a glass.\n\nLIVE ENTERTAINMENT\n\nThere's more happening than just danc
 ing!\n\nWe'll have live performances throughout the evening\, adding a lit
 tle extra spectacle to our Homecoming celebration.\n\nTICKETS & RESERVED T
 ABLES\n\nGeneral Admission — $20 per person\n\nYour invitation to the Ba
 ll! Access to both rooms\, DJs\, live entertainment\, and all the Homecomi
 ng festivities.\n\nCouples Admission — $45 per couple\n\nBring your favo
 rite person and make a night of it.\n\nReserved VIP Table for Four — $14
 9\n\nMake Homecoming a proper night out with:\n\nReserved seating for four
  guests\n\nAdmission for all four guests\n\nA bottle of wine or bubbles fo
 r your table\n\nYour own little home base between dance floor adventures\n
 \nLimited reserved tables available!\n\nTHE DRESS CODE\n\nBLACK & WHITE. D
 RESS TO IMPRESS.\n\nFormal\, semi-formal\, cocktail attire\, vintage glamo
 ur\, creative black-and-white fashion — make it yours.\n\nThis is your e
 xcuse to wear that outfit that's been waiting for an occasion.\n\nAnd if y
 ou never got the Homecoming you deserved?\n\nConsider this your second cha
 nce.\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Avenue | Downtown Santa Rosa\n\n
 Saturday\, November 7\, 2026 7:00 PM 21+ Only\n\nThe dance floor is callin
 g. Your crown might be waiting.\n\nCheck out **BarrelProofLounge.com** for
  all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://BPLHomecoming.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
