 7 – Gunsight Rock at Sugarloaf/Hood Mountain Regional Park. 6.44 miles\,
  2\,129 ft. elevation \\(meet at Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\\).\n\nSun. No
 v. 15 – Sonoma Ridge in Sonoma Developmental Center/Jack London. 9.67 mi
