DESCRIPTION:Call to Artists — Share your newest art creations! Northern 
 California fine artists are invited to enter this annual juried art compet
 ition celebrating the region’s outstanding talent. Bring your artwork to
  the Solano Town Center Gallery\, 1350 Travis Blvd\, Suite D8\, Fairfield\
 , CA\, \\(2nd Floor\\) on Entry Day \\(art drop-off\\): Saturday\, Novembe
 r 7\, 2026\, from 10am to 6pm. A panel of three established professional a
 rtists will consider submissions. 63rd JAS Entry Fee: $45 \\(Includes 3 en
 tries\; each additional entry $10\\). There is no limit to the number of e
 ntries per artist. Get your artwork ready—we look forward to seeing what
  you’ve created! For more information on this event or how to prepare yo
 ur artwork or for categories\, please visit our website: www.fsvaa.art
LOCATION:Solano Town Center Gallery
URL:https://www.fvaa-arts.org/juried-art-show
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Handcrafted for the Holidays: Retro Pop Enamel Pendant
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T160000
UID:261031s4p4_03L5ES82pPfX4V8qQ
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 7\, 2026 1:00 pm to 4:00 pm\n\nLocation\n\
 nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\nDrawing & Painting\, Fiber Arts\, Handcrafted for
  the Holidays\, Other\, Workshops\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nAges
 \n\n16\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$75\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$25\n\nTotal R
 egistration Cost:\n\n$100\n\nReady to turn colorful glass powders into wea
 rable art? Skip the mass-produced accessories and craft something complete
 ly individual. Join us for a hands-on\, beginner-friendly afternoon explor
 ing cloisonné\, which is the ancient art of creating brilliant jewelry us
 ing fine silver wire and vibrant glass enamel fused onto metal.\n\nWhat yo
 u will do\n\nDesign and Bend – Choose either a flower or a navette shape
  and add organic outlines using fine silver wires.\n\nFlow and Fill – Si
 ft your base color and wet pack your design cells with a custom palette of
  powdered glass.\n\nFire the Kiln – Watch your colors fuse into a vibran
 t\, durable\, gemstone-free jewel.\n\nWhy you will love it\n\nZero experie
 nce needed – We pre-enamel the backs of the copper blanks ahead of time 
 so you can dive straight into the fun\, creative parts.\n\nEco-friendly st
 yle – Discover how glass enamel replaces traditional mined gems for a su
 stainable pop of color.\n\nFinished piece – Leave with a custom pendant 
 or charm\, ready for gift-giving.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/retro-pop-enamel-pendant/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
