SUMMARY:An Online Show and Tell / Q & A with Cory Infinite x Svea Herstar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T140000
UID:261024mVPAzZHwhEGs76KQ_2QL_w
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 7\, 2026 12:00 pm to 2:00 pm\n\nNoon \\(PS
 T\\) / 2 PM Kansas City / 3 PM EST\n\nLocation\n\nOnline – Zoom A Zoom l
 ink will be sent out 24 hours before the event date to the registrants.\n\
 nCategory\n\nEvents\, Other\, Sustainability\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Le
 vels\n\nAges\n\nAll Ages\n\nRegistration Cost per Viewer:\n\n$10\n\nJoin C
 ory Infinite & Svea Herstar on Zoom for a live upcycled wearable art demo 
 and Q&A with Trashion Fashion Sonoma and SCC.\n\nprogram overview\n\nIf yo
 u’ve been on Instagram lately and your algorithm recognizes you are of 
 the niche community of people that like to create\, turn trash into treasu
 re or love an upcycled wearable art project then it’s no doubt Cory Infi
 nite \\(Trashion Fashion Sonoma Runway guest judge\\) has turned up on you
 r Instagram feed! Trashion Fashion Sonoma & Sonoma Community Center team u
 p with Kansas City\, MO designers Cory Infinite & Svea Herstar to hear ab
 out how they create\, their process and some of the tools they have used o
 n their famous fits such as the Scrabble Hoodie \\( a together project\,\\
 ) the Keyboard jumpsuit \\(Cory\\) or the Trash Trench \\(Svea.\\) After 
 demo\, they will answer as many questions as time allows. Check out bios b
 elow! As Trashion Fashion Sonoma rolls out their 17th annual Trashion Runw
 ay applications in January 2027 – now is the time to get inspired\, loo
 k at alternative ways to construct and deconstruct materials to tell the s
 tory of wearable art.  Donations are accepted of any amount and supports 
 the artists\, Cory and Svea and continued Sustainability/ Trashion program
 ming and events for non profit\, Sonoma Community Center.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/an-online-show-and-tell-q-a
 -with-cory-infinite-x-svea-herstar/
