BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cuban Salsa Intermediate 4-Week Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T140000
UID:261003WudboqThckGL1MnHX1ydMg
DESCRIPTION:November 7- November 28\n\n1:00 pm – 2:00 pm\n\nTake your da
 ncing to the next level in this focused\, high-energy intensive! Designed 
 for dancers who already know the fundamentals.\n\nCuban salsa Intermediate
  class will move beyond basic steps to focus on complex partner work patte
 rns\, advanced body styling\, dynamic musicality\, and the authentic flow 
 of Cuban Casino.\n\n• 4-week course\, Saturdays\n\n• Date: November 7-
  November 28 \\(4-week\\)\n\n• Time: 1:00 pm – 2:00 Pm\n\n• Location
 : 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\n• Registration Note: Th
 is class requires a minimum of 8 registrations to run. Please register ear
 ly so we can secure the session! Please no walk-ins\n\nPrerequisites\n\n
 • To ensure a fluid\, fast-paced learning environment\, this is an Inter
 mediate level\n\nRequirement: You must have completed a Beginner Cuban Sal
 sa course or have a solid grasp of beginner fundamentals \\(including basi
 c footwork\, timing\, standard left/right turns\, and fundamental partner 
 connection\\).\n\nWhat We Will Cover\n\n• Advanced Partnerwork: Intricat
 e Cuban Casino patterns\, seamless transitions\, and directional changes.\
 n\n• Styling & Body Movement: Incorporating authentic Cuban body isolati
 on and natural expression into your dancing.\n\n• Musicality & Connectio
 n: Refining lead/follow mechanics to hit musical breaks and accents natura
 lly.\n\n• Intensive Structure: We will kick off with a quick body isolat
 ion warm-up and advanced footwork exercises before diving straight into pa
 rtnerwork technique and practical\, social-ready combinations.\n\nCome dan
 ce with us\, elevate your technique\, and experience the energy and flavor
  of Cuba in a supportive and welcoming environment!\n\nImportant Details\n
 \n• Arrival: Please arrive 10 minutes before class starts \\(2:50 PM\\) 
 to check in. • Shoe Policy: No floor-marking shoe soles allowed on the d
 ance floor.\n\n4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa-intermediate/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
