 be partitioned for a variety of uses. With space for 105 booths\, the Hall
  hosts the major trade\, consumer\, and exhibit shows pre sented in Marin 
 County. The Hall also seats up to 1\,000 for luncheons and dinners\; and w
 ith the addition of the portable stage\, is availab le for dinner-dances\,
  corporate parties\, and special events. Venue Info:  Rental Information P
 rice: Free Ticket Info: N/A Event Location: Marin Center Exhibit Hall\, 20
  Avenue of the Flags\, San Rafael\, CA Link: http s://www.artsandcraftssho
 w.com/marin.php\n\nMarin Arts and Crafts Show celebrates the primary compo
 nents of handcraft-bringing toge ther artists\, artisans\, and makers whos
 e work reflects meticulous craf tsmanship\, natural materials\, thoughtful
  design\, and enduring beauty. Explore a diverse collection of fine art\, 
 jewelry\, ceramics\, wood work\, textiles\, artisan foods\, and handcrafte
 d goods that are both be autiful and functional while meeting the people b
 ehind the work.\n\nClick here for more information about the event .
