BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Joy of Astonishment - An Evening of Magic and Mentalism
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T155000
UID:261018uIuiK3rZ0UO070KPyCONaA
DESCRIPTION:Magician and Mentalist Robert Goleman Returns to The Californi
 a with “The Joy of Astonishment” Sunday\, November 8\, at 2:00 PM. If 
 you missed Robert in his last two appearances at The California\, you’ll
  be happy to know that you have another chance! With more than 50 years of
  stage experience\, Robert Goleman invites audiences into a riveting\, int
 imate afternoon of magic and mentalism that has been described as “nothi
 ng short of astonishing.” Blending suspense\, humor\, and genuine audien
 ce connection\, his performance turns every demonstration into a personal 
 encounter – one that feels impossible\, unforgettable\, and beyond expla
 nation. The Joy of Astonishment is more than just another magic show\; it 
 is a shared experience of wonder\, crafted for a close-up theatrical setti
 ng where every reaction matters. Absent from social media for more than a 
 decade\, Goleman’s reputation continues to grow through live performance
 s and enthusiastic word of mouth\, proving that the most powerful promotio
 n is still the one that audiences carry out of the theater with them. For 
 theatergoers drawn to wit\, wonder\, and the thrill of the impossible\, Ro
 bert Goleman offers an intimate afternoon where warmth\, intellect\, and a
 stonishment meet – only at The California. Doors open 1 PM
LOCATION:ca 95401
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1815971892888607/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
