DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Master Gardener Bruce Robinson presents which bu
 gs are good for your garden and which can cause harm! This talk will assis
 t home gardeners in creating productive vegetable gardens using insectary 
 plants that are intentionally introduced to attract the "good" bugs to you
 r garden. These "good" bugs will help to biologically control the "bad" bu
 gs that cause damage to plants. Registration Encouraged: Visit Upcoming Ev
 ents to complete your registration. After registering\, you will receive a
  confirmation email containing information about attending the library tal
 k. Learn about home gardening\, pest management\, water conservation pract
 ices\, and more from your Sonoma County UC Master Gardeners! Different pre
 sentation topic per location.
