SUMMARY:Sit & Stitch 3:30 to 5:30
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T173000
UID:261019hF02zHfDp0mH6LFnJyrV0A
DESCRIPTION:Sit & Stitch on every Monday 3:30 and 5:30 PM. You can drop in
  for any amount of time. We have the supplies to help people get started o
 n needle felting\, knitting\, macrame\, and crocheting. We can start needl
 e felting Ornaments and other fun objects for the Holidays. We will also h
 ave tea\, so bring your favorite covered drink container. Sit and Stitch i
 s for people to come and work on any fiber arts activity that they have wh
 ile visiting with others. Most people will bring their own projects\, but 
 we always have hooks\, needles\, and yarn and sometimes we will offer a pr
 oject with instructions that people may choose to make. Let us know what y
 ou would like to learn this year. We now have a working sewing machine for
  people to use. For beginners\, I will bring is some fabric to make pillow
 cases. If you have a project that you would like to work on\, bring in you
 r fabric and thread and you can use the machine. We share ideas\, skills\,
  and encouragement with each other. This summer we will be adding\, weavin
 g\, and decorative mending to our regular projects of knitting and crochet
 ing. Children can come if they are accompanied one to one with an adult.
LOCATION:Guerneville Library
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/sit-stitch-330-530-121270
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
