DESCRIPTION:TroyBoi's music has been categorized as trap\, house\, bass\, 
 future bass\, vogue\, and dubstep. There’s also a strong Middle eastern 
 and Indian music influence on his music.\n\n"The Ruins" is an abandoned ce
 ment factory built in the early 1900's. Located 25 miles outside of San Fr
 ancisco\, the Ruins is a marvel. Exposed architecture\, grafittied walls\,
  open are stage\, this checks all the boxes.\n\nFull bar and food trucks w
 ill be available. 21\\+ Event
LOCATION:The Ruins
