DESCRIPTION:A free monthly community arts event! The second Friday Vallejo
  Art Walk has energize downtown Vallejo since 2014\,\n\nVallejo has a vibr
 ant arts community. You'll find local artists\, hand made crafts\, gallery
  openings hosted by local artists\, open shops\, restaurants\, live music\
 , and so much more! Outdoor vendors set up on the 600 block of Marin Stree
 t\, between Georgia and Virginia Streets and additional vendors\, activiti
 es\, and arts and culture happenings are all throughout the entire downtow
 n area. Join our email newsletter at vallejoartwalk.org to learn more deta
 ils about the event. Come out and enjoy! There is always something new!
