BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back pOrchEstra/s American Roots at Rio Nido Roadhouse Sat Nov 14 
 4-7 pm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
UID:261103oa9q6dK2P0a6Bk1Zq1yb_g
DESCRIPTION:Back pOrchEstra/s American Roots music at Rio Nido Roadhouse S
 at Nov 14 4-7 pm\n\ncovered patio show.\n\n14540 Canyon 2 Road\, Rio Nido\
 , Ca - 707.869.0821\n\nhttps://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar\n\nRoots 
 Rock\, Americana\, Country Blues\, Western Swing\, Cajun\, Indie-Rock\, Ne
 w Orleans and singer-songwriter music. The band presents new originals as 
 well as historic American Roots material with rich acoustic tones.\n\nCand
 y Girard \\(Delaney Bramlet\, Clint Black\, Jerry Garcia\\) on violin\, Lu
 is Rodriguez \\(Gator Beat\\) on drums\, Joshua Zucker \\(Wreckless Strang
 ers\\) on bass\, Steve Black on guitar and Tim Eschliman \\(Etta James\, C
 ommander Cody\\) on vocals & resonator guitar.\n\nCheck out the recent "St
 ories In The Heart" album\, listen now!: https://orcd.co/5xga7nr\n\nmore a
 bout Back pOrchEstra:\n\n"The guitars slam like saloon doors\, the violin 
 traces lines that oscillate between melancholy and jubilation\, the rhythm
  section moves forward with a tranquil groove that never rushes but never 
 falters... Back pOrchEstra delivers a luminous\, earthy\, profoundly human
  record. An album that makes you want to sit on a porch\, watch the sunset
 \, and let the stories do their work...." - Fred Delforge\, Zicazine\n\n".
 ..What sets 'Stories In The Heart' apart is its sense of balance. Resonato
 r guitar\, violin\, bass\, drums\, percussion\, dobro\, and Telecaster cre
 ate a flexible\, roots-forward palette that allows Back Porchestra to move
  between styles fluidly. The songs echo traditions without reenacting them
 \, keeping one foot in the past and the other firmly planted in the presen
 t." - Vince's Hot Picks \\(Best of 2026\\) New Releases Now\n\nBack pOrchE
 stra is a compact Shelter-in-Place-inspired musical combo ....going back t
 o the basics... Formed for the first time the locked-down summer of 2020. 
 The band draws from new original material as well as reworked classics by 
 Hank Williams\, Taj Mahal\, Dan Hicks\, Big Bill Broonzy\, Bob Wills\, Bob
 by Charles ...even Christmas Jug Band tunes\n\n... check out the "Dusty Ro
 ad I'm On" video: https://youtu.be/jj0IIkUyrE4 ...a twangy roots rock numb
 er with a Cajun flavor and hints of Jesse Ed Davis and Sid Page....\n\nLPs
 \, CDs\, and USB-Music Cards available all over\, including https://www.gl
 oberecords.com\n\n"...evokes artists from multiple decades over the last c
 entury and embraces everything from indie-rock and Americana to Celtic\, M
 otown\, and Western swing. If you need a reference point\, look to bands l
 ike Dan Hicks and His Hot Licks and Asleep at the Wheel\, whose records al
 so draw on disparate sources." - Jeff Burger\, Americana Highway\n\nmore a
 t... https://www.BackpOrchEstra.com\n\nBandCamp: https://backporchestra.ba
