BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nov & Dec Artwalks: "Moments in the Light"  Plein Air Painting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T143000
UID:261103AaKny9BAvEyGT1sXU_jGlQ
DESCRIPTION:Plein Air painting is painting on location responding to the e
 nvironment as it moves you. For us it’s not about the details or exact c
 haracteristics of a location but rather the interaction of color\, the atm
 osphere\, the feeling of standing out there. It's about the immediate mome
 nt of seeing which is in the brushwork of several of the artists\, creatin
 g a dialogue with the space as you make the marks and see how they corresp
 ond to what's in front of you. There is no right or wrong because it is a 
 very personal moment. It's not impressionism. It's not quite expressionism
 . But it's the immediacy of being alive. \n\nMost of the paintings were d
 one when Barry convinced one of the other artists to come painting with hi
 m. Creating a synergy from the overlapping influence on each other while k
 eeping a distinct POV.
LOCATION:McCune Collection
URL:http://www.mccunecollection.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
