DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T160000
UID:261105rxFphZDeaUmAFwaCF1z3Dw
DESCRIPTION:Join us in celebrating Marimar's birthday with a 7-course meal
  of classic Spanish dishes from Marimar's cookbooks paired with our rarest
  vintage wines in up to 3-liter and 5-liter bottles. This special celebrat
