DESCRIPTION:In this two week workshop\, students will learn a unique appro
 ach to watercolor\, intended to address the frustration that many feel wit
 h this challenging medium. The class will focus on strengthening one’s o
 bservational skills\, while learning a watercolor technique that teaches t
 he artist to see value and color. \n\nOver the two weeks we will work on 
 1 painting\, progressing through guided steps to build a luminous botanica
 l painting. With a mix of demonstrations and individualized instruction\, 
 students of all experience levels will develop new skills and have a meani
 ngful creative experience.
