DESCRIPTION:Chalk Hill Garden to Glass Series - Fall invites guests to exp
 erience the beauty and bounty of the estate through a seasonal culinary jo
 urney. The experience begins with a guided exploration of Chalk Hill's lus
 h culinary gardens\, followed by a hyper-seasonal\, garden-inspired four-c
 ourse menu prepared by the Estate Culinary team. Each course is thoughtful
 ly paired with Chalk Hill wines\, highlighting the depth\, character\, and
  sense of place found in every pour. Together\, the garden tour\, seasonal
  cuisine\, and wine create an elevated sensory experience rooted in the es
 tate. Space is limited\, and advance reservations are required.
