 the Holidays\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\n
 Registration Cost:\n\n$40\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$5\n\nTotal Registration Co
 st:\n\n$45\n\nIn this relaxing holiday workshop\, you’ll transform heavy
 weight paper and watercolor into charming 3D birds with sculptural wings. 
 Paint them in unexpected colors\, add your own patterns and details\, then
  cut and assemble the pieces into birds that are ready to take flight.No a
 rt experience is necessary. We’ll take you through the process step by s
 tep\, leaving plenty of room for your own ideas and imagination. Each bird
  will be as individual as the person who makes it—perfect for hanging in
  a window\, from a branch\, or on the holiday tree.Make one for yourself\,
  one to give\, or keep going and create a small flock. These little birds 
 are beautiful\, personal gifts and a lovely way to add something handmade 
 to the holiday season.
