BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T170000
UID:261004Rl9mWMxU60OmCYCpTEFwwQ
DESCRIPTION:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design\n\nCr
 eated in collaboration with the Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.\n\n
 EAMES & EAMES explores the iterative\, hands-on\, and human-centered appr
 oach of Charles & Ray Eames. Through furniture\, toys\, paintings\, graphi
 cs\, and personal belongings collected over their lifetimes\, this groundb
 reaking exhibition looks beyond the iconic Eames chairs to reveal the brea
 dth of their creative practice. More than any single object\, their work o
 pened doors to new and unexpected ways of seeing\, thinking\, making\, and
  understanding the world—ideas that continue to inspire us today.\n\nCur
 ated by Llisa Demetrios\, Co-Founder & The Lucia Eames Chief Curator of th
 e Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.
LOCATION:The MAC - Napa Valley Museum of Art & Culture
URL:https://napavalleymuseum.org/blogs/upcoming-exhibitions/eames-eames
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Taco Tuesday Bike Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T000000
UID:260504TqYHso7muE6gRbuvoAm7mg
DESCRIPTION:A fun community bike ride through the heart of Santa Rosa. Com
 e join us this Tuesday! We roll through the JC and McDonald Ave neighborho
 od\, stop in Courthouse Square\, then on to the taco trucks at Mitote Food
  Park in Roseland for dinner! We depart Mitote at 8:15pm\, ride back throu
 gh Courthouse Square\, then on to Yogurt Farms for dessert. This ride is 8
  miles round trip and rides all year long. Rides canceled for rain and hol
 idays. All riders welcome. Bring the whole family! Meet at SRJC parking lo
 t at 550 Silva Ave. We are renting the use of this parking lot every Tuesd
 ay from 5:30pm to 9:30 pm. Taco Tuesday riders can park in the lot during 
 that time frame for free. Please park cars along the back wall on the east
  side. And stage in the row on the northern side of the lot \\(closest to 
 Silva Ave\\). Meet at 5:30pm\; pedals up at 6pm.
LOCATION:SRJC Parking Lot
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
