BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Read to a Dog: Meet Allie!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T153000
UID:261023-I2Mg5qNqUiHKXvQPIdEAQ
DESCRIPTION:By providing safe\, positive interaction with animals\,Read to
  a Dog offers children a relaxed\, non-judgmental environment in which to 
 practice reading. The benefits of reading to animals have been documented 
 to include increased reading fluency and improved attitudes about reading 
