UID:261104kLA6Vw1avkyu5gN982kAEQ
DESCRIPTION:Have fun\, enjoy music\, and discover handmade treasures! The 
 Marin County Employee Arts & Crafts Fair returns November 18–19\, from 1
 1 a.m.–4 p.m.\, at the Marin Civic Center cafeteria\, Room 237\, in San 
 Rafael.\n\nShop handcrafts and original art while listening to the County 
 Crows employee band. Different vendors and music each day--visit twice!\n\
 nCraving something sweet? The HR & Friends Bake charity sale and individua
 l bakers sell treats on Wednesday only.\n\nCelebrating its 26th anniversar
 y\, this staff-founded tradition is open to the public. Employees particip
 ate on their own time\, and volunteers in the county's MarinShares program
  provide support. \n\nBrowse original paintings\, drawings\, woodcuts\, a
 nd photographs. Crafts include ceramics\, jewelry\, paper art\, potted pla
 nts\, crocheted dolls\, notecards\, candles\, knitted and crocheted wearab
 les\, and lots more.
LOCATION:Marin County Employee Arts & Crafts Fair
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/marin-county-arts-craft
 s-fair/20282610/2026-11-18T11
