 enter\, where we will have a brief tour of the center and its display area
 . A field trip of birding and nest box cleaning will follow. Bring a lunch
  and we will eat at Three Tree Hill which offers a great view of Pepperwoo
 d. Rain cancels. Bring your binoculars\, field guide\, and liquids\; wear 
