BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Abbotts Lagoon Birds
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T140000
UID:2609154CYtim1MHUmSpj-3WC2RRg
DESCRIPTION:Directions: Meet at Abbotts Lagoon parking lot. From Hwy 101 i
 n Larkspur\, take the exit for Sir Francis Drake Blvd west 20.4 miles to O
 lema. Turn right onto Hwy 1 and go 2 miles. Turn left onto Sir Francis Dra
 ke Blvd and go 6.4 miles. Turn right at Pierce Point Rd and go 3.4 miles\,
  the trailhead is on the left.\n\nSponsor: Parks\n\nAccommodation Informat
 ion: If you are a person with a disability and require an accommodation to
  participate in a County program\, service\, or activity\, r equests may b
 e made by calling 415-473-4381 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial&n bsp\;711 for CA Relay\
 , or by submitting a\n\nDisability Accommodation Request\n\nat least five 
 business days in advance of the event. We will do our best to fulfill requ
 ests received with less than five business days' notice. Copies of documen
 ts are available in alternative formats upon request.\n\nWe'll take advant
 age of the outer reaches of the county to enjoy the numerous species of bi
 rds that are found along the coast this time of year\; some are migrating 
 to southern destinations\, some will stay for the winter\, and some are ye
  ar-round residents. This is a great place to see raptors\, shorebirds\, a
 nd waterfowl that aren't as prevalent in other parts of Marin. T otal mile
 s: 3. There's little elevation change but we'll be wa lking on sand part o
 f the way. This walk is offered in partnership with Point Reyes National S
 eashore. Remember to bring lunch\, and binoculars if you have them. No pet
 s are allowed\, except for service/companion animals. Adverse weather or p
 oor air quality may cancel. Registration is required.\n\nQuestions: Contac
 t\n\nshannon.burke%40marincounty.gov\n\nShannon Burke
LOCATION:Point Reyes National Seashore
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
