DESCRIPTION:Sip a pint and blend your own custom perfume or cologne at Cro
 oked Goat Brewing. Boho Bungalow’s Fragrance Lab hosts a holiday scent n
 ight led by founder Faith Parker\, who studied perfumery in Grasse\, Franc
