BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Nights with DJ BRXNDO – Live in The Lounge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T235900
UID:260929zVXLDeEwl0OfUNcFvvQaAw
DESCRIPTION:THURSDAY NIGHTS WITH DJ BRXNDO OPEN FORMAT • REQUESTS • DA
 NCING • NO COVER\n\nThursday nights have a new home in The Lounge at Bar
 rel Proof. Every Thursday at 9 PM\, DJ BRXNDO takes over the front room wi
 th an open-format set built around the crowd\, the dance floor and your re
 quests.\n\nBRXNDO has been making his way through the Bay Area nightlife s
 cene\, spinning parties from Santa Rosa to San Francisco. Now he's settlin
 g into a weekly Thursday night residency at Barrel Proof.\n\nOpen format m
 eans just that: no single genre gets to run the night. BRXNDO can move thr
 ough Reggaeton\, Hip-Hop\, Latin hits\, Top 40\, throwbacks\, dance tracks
  and party favorites depending on where the room takes him.\n\nHear someth
 ing you want? Make a request.\n\nSome Thursdays might lean Latin. Some mig
 ht turn into a throwback party. Some nights might go somewhere completely 
 different. BRXNDO reads the room and keeps it moving.\n\nWhatever else is 
 happening at Barrel Proof that night\, The Lounge belongs to BRXNDO every 
 Thursday at 9.\n\nDJ BRXNDO Every Thursday 9 PM The Lounge at Barrel Proof
  501 Mendocino Ave • Downtown Santa Rosa 21+ No Cover\n\nCheck out **www
 .BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thursday-nights-with-dj-brxndo-live-in-th
 e-lounge-tickets-2002239002756?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:EVENT SERIES* Nature as Medicine: Forest Immersion De-Stress Exper
 ience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T133000
UID:260916A_bRd0_DJkisaJ0PzqDKFw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a stress-relieving Nature as Medicine session in t
 he SSU Native Plant and Butterfly Garden. Led by Dr. Sarah Murphy\, take a
  moment to enjoy a mellow\, calm and tech-free immersion in nature. Studie
 s on forest immersion experiences like this have demonstrated they decreas
 e stress levels\, anxiety\, and increase mood\, attention\, feelings of co
 nnectedness and well-being\, and even help boost the immune system. We hop
 e the experience will help you feel refreshed\, grounded\, and mentally re
 charged!
LOCATION:Sonoma State University
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/nature-as-medicine-experience
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T170000
UID:2608241GAO4zLG5UKCjpHEzGOopA
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja - Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T183000
UID:260817PmgIJZtPkEuAJJcwJaVnng
DESCRIPTION:DATE AND TIME: Thursdays\, 5:30 PM\n\nUnlock your inner streng
 th and find your flow. Belly dancing with Raja is an innovative fusion cl
 ass that blends the rhythmic artistry of belly dance with the high-energ
 y benefits of aerobics. Designed to be both a cardiovascular challenge an
 d a deep toning session\, this class focuses on the “powerhouse” of th
 e body—your core.\n\nBy layering fluid\, isolative movements over an ath
 letic aerobic base\, you will challenge your muscles in ways traditional g
 ym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to Expect in Belly Dancing Class\n\n•
  Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage deep abdomina
 l muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functional Stability
 : Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-driven moveme
 nts and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning: Build lean
  muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a constant\, he
 art-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your coordination 
 and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography.\n\n“Wheth
 er you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a workout that
  feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect balance of sweat
  and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No prior dance ex
 perience is required—just bring your energy and a willingness to move.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
