SUMMARY:AURORA SINGH headlines Friday Night Comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T220000
UID:261103_tftK6YwEkWs9yNLlovR9w
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa with Auror
 a Singh\n\nStand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TABLES NOW AVAILA
 BLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own private call but
 ton to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (or a bottle of
  wine) for only $95! Every Friday night hilarious comedians from The Bay A
 rea and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around after for late
 -night karaoke!\n\nFresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis Week: Host: 
 Josh Argyle Noah Radke Drew Shafer\n\nHeadliner: Aurora Singh\n\nSome call
  her a rare breed\, I would agree. Aurora Singh blessed her immigrant pare
 nts with her arrival into the world in January 1992 and continuously douse
 d her sparkle upon the world as she grew up in Sacramento\, California in 
 the good ol’ Catholic school system. You won’t regret the deep belly l
 aughs you experience as a result of her hilarious straight forward real co
 medy. After 9 years of bringing the funny\, Aurora has been featured on Si
 rius XM\, ABC’s The 100K Pyramid and has performed with incredible comed
 ians such as Sheng Wang\, Greg Fitzsimons\, Anthony Jeselnik\, Roy Wood Jr
 . and Hasan Minhaj. She has also entered the college and cruise markets no
 w taking her reach nationally! Her mom has even been quoted saying\, “sh
 e’s hilarious!” Ready to ride the giggle train? All aboard! -Recurring
  feature at Laughs Unlimited Comedy Club in Sacramento\, CA. -Recurring Li
 ve Nation host: hosts at San Francisco Punch Line\, Sacramento Punch Line\
 , and Cobb's Comedy Club. -Recurring feature at Loonee’s Comedy Corner\,
  Colorado Springs\, CO. -Recurring host at Rooster T. Feathers Comedy Club
 \, Sunnyvale\, CA. -Recurring feature act for Mic Drop Comedy Club San Die
 go. -Headliner Laughingstock Comedy Club\, Bakersfield\, CA. -Showcase pro
 ducer with Live Nation at the Sacramento Punch Line. -Showcase producer at
  Sacramento Comedy Spot. -Accepted into Women in Comedy Festival 2020. -Wo
 rld Series of Comedy Semi-Finalist 2020. -Big Pine Comedy Festival “Best
  of Fest” award 2022. -Made virtual Chocolate Sundaes history by getting
  100% of the audience vote to move to the live show at the Hollywood Laugh
  Factory 2022. -Sac Town Comedy Get Down Festival “Best of Fest” 2022.
  -World Series of Comedy Semi-Finalist 2022 -World Series of Comedy Laughs
  Unlimited Semi-Finalist 2023 -Season 6 Episode 15 of the 100K Pyramid on 
 ABC and Hulu -APCA Comedian of the Year 2025 -Regular headlining act on No
 rwegian Cruise Lines Check out her website at **https://www.aurorasinghcom
 edy.com/**\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door\n\nCheck out **w
 ww.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/aurora-singh-headlines-friday-night-comed
 y-in-downtown-santa-rosa-tickets-2001405654188?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
