DESCRIPTION:INDIGENOUS FASHION TAKES CENTER STAGE IN SANTA ROSA\n\nSANTA R
 OSA\, CA — Finest Feathers proudly presents the 4th Annual Threads of Th
 under Indigenous Fashion Show on Friday\, November 20\, 2026\, at the Sono
 ma County Fairgrounds – Finley Hall.\n\nThis powerful evening will bring
  Indigenous creativity to the runway through Native designers\, models\, a
 rtists\, vendors\, and live entertainment — all while celebrating cultur
 e\, community\, entrepreneurship\, and the next generation of Indigenous t
 alent.\n\nMore than a fashion show\, Threads of Thunder is a celebration o
 f Indigenous excellence and an opportunity for the community to come toget
 her\, support Native creatives\, and experience contemporary Indigenous fa
 shion in Northern California.\n\nDoors Open: 4:00 PM for Vendor Market | S
 how: 5:00–8:00 PM Sonoma County Fairgrounds – Finley Hall | Santa Rosa
 \, CA\n\nTickets are on sale now at FinestFeathers.com\n\nTHREADS OF THUND
 ER — Where Culture Meets the Runway.
