 meras\, or Video/Audio Recording Devices\, No Cans\, Bottles\, weapons of 
 any kind. Doors Open at 1 Hour prior to event Box Office Opens 2 Hours pri
 or to event Who's Bad: The Ultimate Michael Jackson Experience is a high-e
 nergy\, live concert celebration of the music\, movement\, and spirit of M
 ichael Jackson. Founded in 2003\, Who's Bad is the longest-running Michael
  Jackson tribute in the world\, performing over 2\,500 shows worldwide and
  captivating audiences across the U.S.\, Europe\, Asia\, and beyond. Inspi
 red by Michael's legendary live tours\, the show features a full live band
 \, dynamic dancers\, iconic choreography\, and the unforgettable hits that
