UID:261027t86HihQ8VEi52GGsoHaorA
DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturdays at Inner Light Crystals for Rock Talk - a fr
 ee weekly exploration of rocks\, minerals\, crystals\, geology\, and the f
 ascinating things the Earth creates.\n\nEach week we explore something a l
 ittle different\, from mineral families and formations to unusual specimen
 s\, geological processes\, and the details that make rocks and minerals so
  interesting.\n\nCome curious. Bring your questions. Geek out with us.\n\n
 Rock Talk begins at 12 PM and typically runs approximately 30–60 minutes
 .\n\nFREE to attend.\n\nInner Light Crystals\n\n4936 Sonoma Hwy\n\nSanta R
 osa\, CA\n\nSaturdays at Noon
LOCATION:Inner Light Crystals
URL:http://www.innerlightcrystalshop.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Games at the Lodge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T180000
UID:2610274zN695qpdEuA2KBdjXLNaQ
DESCRIPTION:Games at the Lodge\, where neighbors come to play.\n\nFree Mon
 thly Board & Card Games in Historic Downtown Vallejo\n\nOdd Fellows San Pa
 blo Lodge \\#43 invites the community to Games at the Lodge\, a new series
  of FREE monthly board and card game gatherings in the historic San Pablo 
 Lodge game room at 342 Georgia Street in Vallejo.\n\nGames at the Lodge wi
 ll be held every third Saturday of the month from 2:00 to 6:00 PM\, creati
 ng a friendly place for neighbors to meet\, learn new games\, and simply e
 njoy playing together.\n\nNOVEMBER FEATURED GAME: EUCHRE\n\nOur inaugural 
 featured game is Euchre\, the classic and lively card game especially popu
 lar in the Midwest. Never played? No problem!\n\nOur friendly Game Masters
  will teach you how to play\, explain the basics\, and help you join a gam
 e. Come by yourself\, bring a friend\, or bring a group.\n\nFREE • BEGIN
 NERS WELCOME • NO EXPERIENCE REQUIRED • NO MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED\n\nWhet
 her you're an experienced card player\, a board-game enthusiast\, or simpl
 y looking for a fun and welcoming way to meet people in Vallejo\, there's 
 a seat at the table for you.\n\nREFRESHMENTS & TREATS\n\nComplimentary lig
 ht refreshments will be provided by the Odd Fellows Lodge.\n\nGuests can a
 lso enjoy gourmet hand-muddled Italian or still lemonade and other premium
  treats for a nominal fee.\n\nCome for a game. Meet your neighbors. Stay f
 or another round.\n\nFirst Event: Saturday\, November 21 • 2:00–6:00 P
 M | Then Every Third Saturday • 2:00–6:00 PM
LOCATION:Odd Fellows Hall
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/games-at-the-lodge/2027
 4658/2026-11-21T14
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
