BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga on Tower Hill
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T093000
UID:261011k1mKq2RjlUCaaxxdfH5_ZA
DESCRIPTION:Set against the sweeping hills above Tomales Bay\, our outdoor
  yoga sessions offer a peaceful setting to move\, breathe\, and connect. A
 s morning light spreads across the water\, each class invites you to groun
 d yourself in stillness and balance\, surrounded by the natural rhythms of
  Point Reyes landscape.\n\nLed by experienced instructors from The Yoga Po
 st Petaluma. These sessions are designed for all levels and focuses on min
 dful movement with fresh air and open space\, encouraging balance and grou
 nding while improving overall health and wellness.\n\nClasses take place e
 very Saturday morning at 9:30am on Tower Hill\, weather permitting. Mats a
 re provided and participation is complimentary for overnight guest. The ge
 neral public is welcome to join for a small fee.
LOCATION:Lodge at Marconi
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/yoga-on-tower-hill/2012
 1347/2026-11-21T09
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:You are Invited to North Bay Speech Masters Toastmasters Club Meet
 ing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T113000
UID:260903jIP2l3ZNpkOp0BYolkb9rg
DESCRIPTION:Whether it's improving our health\, focusing on professional a
 dvancement\, learning a new skill\, it is often helpful to obtain someone 
 to help learn new skills like speaking without preparation. The group at T
 oastmasters can help.\n\nWe call speaking without preparation\, impromptu 
 speaking. If you want to learn new Impromptu speaking skills\, Toastmaster
 s can help. During the meeting\, we will practice our impromptu speaking s
 kills during our session we call Table Topics. During the Table Topics\, t
 he speaker is given a question\, and they are asked to speak for 60 second
 s to 2 minutes about the question.\n\nOutside Toastmasters\, impromptu spe
 aking happens constantly. You might recognize it in moments such as:\n\n--
 Being asked for your opinion in a meeting\n\n--Responding to a follow-up q
 uestion during a presentation\n\n--Introducing yourself or someone else un
 expectedly\n\n--Handling a difficult or unplanned question\n\nYou can lear
 n tips and tricks about speaking off the cuff at our meeting. Won't you jo
 in us and learn\n\nwhat Toastmasters can do to help you on your profession
 al journey.\n\nFeel free to contact us for the zoon link at our website un
 der the "Contact Us" button. The website is https://3038.toastmastersclubs
 .org\n\nWe hold meetings online and in-person. If joining us in-person\, t
 here is limited parking in the front lot. Once in the front door\, please 
 sign in at the computer to obtain a visitors' badge. \\(IUsually\, there i
 s a sheet by the computer telling you how to log in for Toastmasters.\\) I
 f the sheet isn't there\, the clerk at the desk can help. Then take the el
 evator down to the second floor\, and take a left out of the elevator and 
 a left at the hall and come down to the meeting room.
LOCATION:Cogir of the North Bay
URL:https://3038.toastmastersclubs.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T170000
UID:260824NsNO-yrTsEO6vuv2P2OdkA
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginner Marin – Saturday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T110000
UID:260317PIgsx8pdeUSvgt2hk41Gcg
DESCRIPTION:**Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?** Join on 
 on Saturday – Salsa Beginner Marin\n\nAre you a beginner who’s always 
 wanted to learn salsa? Salsa classes are designed to help you build a stro
 ng foundation. In this class\, you’ll learn the fundamental footwork\, p
 ractice the basic turns\, and understand the essential body movement that 
 will make you feel confident on the dance floor. This class is perfect for
  anyone ready to learn the techniques and foundational steps needed to sta
 rt their salsa journey.\n\nSalsa is fun\, and we make learning it stress-f
 ree! Our relaxed\, beginner-friendly class is the ideal starting point. Yo
 u don’t need a partner\, nor any dance experience!\n\nIn this class you 
 will learn:\n\nBasic directional steps that form the foundation of salsa.\
 n\nProper frame for comfortable and effective partner-work.\n\nSimple\, ea
 sy-to-remember turn patterns.\n\nGet ready to learn the fundamentals and h
 ave a great time!\n\n**Details:**\n\n**No partner necessary**—rotations 
 ensure everyone dances\n\nPlease wear **non-marking shoes** to protect t
 he floor\n\nArrive 10 minutes early\; warm up and settle in\n\n**When:** 
 Saturday\, 10:00 am – 11:00 am\n\n**Where:** 4140 Redwood Highway #8\, 
 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8\, San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-saturday/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
