DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T100000
UID:260817qHft1wq2eky2_6uAzusWIg
DESCRIPTION:The Healdsburg Community\, including locals and visitors\, com
 es together for the 15th annual Healdsburg Turkey Trot at 8:00am on Thank
 sgiving Day 2026.  Presented by the Rotary Club of Healdsburg Sunrise and
  Healdsburg Running Company\, in partnership with the City of Healdsburg\,
  this event invites everyone\, from competitive runners to families with s
 trollers\, to join in the 5K fun.  Expect a lively crowd of up to 5\,000 
 runners and walkers\, decked out in costumes\, festive hats\, and even tur
 key feathers.  Together we help Healdsburg’s high-achieving Scholar-Ath
 letes LIVE LIKE DREW!  This slice of community is the best start to a Tha
 nksgiving full of heart\, health\, and Healdsburg cheer.  Registration op
 ens September 1 at 5ktrot.com
LOCATION:Start and Finish at Healdsburg Running Company
URL:http://5ktrot.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
