BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Public Star Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T220000
UID:260514L6uN5LDZX0iaHpEGG0cdmw
DESCRIPTION:Public Star Parties are the heart of the Robert Ferguson Obser
 vatory—your monthly invitation to experience the wonder of the night sky
  like never before. Whether you’re a lifelong astronomy enthusiast or si
 mply curious about what lies beyond our planet\, these gatherings offer so
 mething magical for everyone.Each month includes a variety of engaging ast
 ronomy presentations led by our expert docents. You’ll hear fascinating 
 stories about the cosmos and the science behind some of the objects you’
 ll soon be observing. These talks set the stage for an unforgettable night
  under the stars.Step outside into the darkness of Sugarloaf Ridge State P
 ark\, where the skies open up in breathtaking clarity. You’ll have the c
 hance to explore the universe through three of RFO’s massive telescopes\
 , each powerful enough to reveal extraordinary detail: lunar craters\, pla
 nets\, star clusters\, glowing nebulae\, distant galaxies\, and more. In a
 ddition\, a field of smaller telescopes brought and operated by dedicated 
 volunteers\, creates a dynamic\, community-powered observing experience.Ev
 ery month offers a new selection of celestial treasures\, and our friendly
 \, knowledgeable docents are excited to guide you. They’ll help you navi
 gate the night sky\, answer questions\, and point out objects that many pe
 ople never get the chance to see.Come experience the excitement\, curiosit
 y\, and shared sense of discovery that make Public Star Parties such a che
 rished RFO tradition. Free for members—and unforgettable for everyone!
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory 
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/public-star-parties-2026-tickets-240100
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MEAN DAVE headlines Friday Night Comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T220000
UID:261106eUEPuiMlY0uCLttfBt3cvA
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa with Mean 
 Dave\n\nStand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa VIP TABLES NOW AVAILABLE! S
 nag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own private call button to
  summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (or a bottle of wine)
  for only $95! Every Friday night hilarious comedians from The Bay Area an
 d beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around after for late-night
  karaoke!\n\nFresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis Week: Host: Josh A
 rgyle Paulie Escobedo Headliner: Mean Dave\n\nMEAN DAVE is a stand-up come
 dian. He is a regular at Cobb's Comedy Club\, Punch Line in SF and Sacrame
 nto and Rooster T. Feathers and has opened for headliners such as Judy Ten
 uta\, Big Jay Oakerson\, Allan Havey\, Tom Rhodes\, Neil Hamburger\, Brent
  Morin\, Bret Ernst and most importantly\, Barry Sobel. Most of Dave's lif
 e has been littered with utter disappointment and flat out betrayal that o
 nly a sarcastic\, cynical sense of humor can remedy. Hopefully this inform
 ation helps you in your decision as to whether Mean Dave's comedy will hel
 p you attain laughter as you hopefully progress through futile existence. 
 21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door Check out **BarrelProofLounge.
 com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/mean-dave-headlines-friday-night-comedy-i
 n-downtown-santa-rosa-tickets-2001406381363?aff=oddtdtcreator
