SUMMARY:Santa's Riverboat Arrival & Small Business Saturday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T133000
UID:260820Q8gQJPoEY0iJut3UbknD6A
DESCRIPTION:Head to the River Plaza Shopping Center on E. Washington St. t
 o watch Santa and Mrs. Claus cruise into town on a Lind Marine tugboat Sat
 urday\, November 28\, for photos and festivities.\n\nArrive at 11:30 am wi
 th your family and friends to enjoy live entertainment from the Pacific Em
 pire Chorus while waiting for Santa and Mrs. Claus to arrive! By noon\, th
 e couple will disembark at the Turning Basin. Young Nutcracker-costumed da
 ncers from Petaluma School of Ballet will escort the couple to their speci
 al holiday tent adjacent to Taps on the River for photos with eager childr
 en. The jolly pair will leave at 1:30 pm for their next stop on their holi
 day tour.\n\nNovember 28 is also Shop Small Saturday. As you queue up for 
 photos\, grab a Shop Small bag filled with items from local merchants\, wh
 ile supply lasts. Bring your holiday shopping lists and support local! His
 toric downtown\, filled with boutiques from chic to quirky and fortifying 
 farm-to-table dining and tasting rooms\, is just a couple blocks away. The
  kids will love spotting Holiday Hen Hunt chickens in shop windows to fill
  their bingo cards for a chance to win prizes! More about that here: petal
 umadowntown.com/holiday-hen-hunt.\n\nIf you’re coming from out of town\,
  the festivities are just three blocks from the Petaluma Downtown Smart St
 ation\, so you can skip the parking and the traffic\, while doing a solid 
 for the planet.
LOCATION:River Plaza Shopping Center
URL:https://petalumadowntown.com/santa-riverboat-arrival
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
