UID:2610226OUH--xRNU2g8caXfdcZNQ
DESCRIPTION:Holiday Celebration \\+ Marketplace Public Event 12-4 p.m. - 2
 1 & Older Only - No Children or Pets Allowed Kick off the most wonderful t
 ime of the year with a decades-long Dry Creek Vineyard tradition: our annu
 al Holiday Celebration and Marketplace. Sample a selection of limited-rele
 ase wines perfect for giving and gathering\, while you enjoy holiday class
 ics sung by carolers and savor seasonal bites. Peruse charming gifts from 
