DESCRIPTION:Open Monday through Saturday from 7:00 AM to 7:00 PM and Sunda
 y from 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM\, our Christmas tent is your complete destinatio
 n for trimming and decorating\, featuring artificial trees\, fresh wreaths
  and garland\, ornaments\, and indoor and outdoor lights. Just steps away\
 , The Gift Horse\, our home store\, carries holiday décor\, candles\, gif
 ts\, and stocking stuffers\, allowing families to pick out the tree and co
 mplete their gift list in one trip. Guests can enjoy a daily hot cocoa bar
 \, complimentary candy canes\, and a Letters to Santa station\, along with
  weekly visits from Santa every Saturday from 12:00 PM to 2:00 PM. Special
  season highlights include a Bring Your Pet Edition for Santa photos on De
 cember 13th from 12:00 PM to 2:00 PM\, plus gift wrapping lessons at The G
 ift Horse on November 15th from 1:00 PM to 2:00 PM and December 9th from 1
 2:00 PM to 1:00 PM.
