BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pianist Larry Vuchovich Birthday Celebration At Sebastiani Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T170000
UID:260728N7Ld8kL33UG9Rqy8mpPPWQ
DESCRIPTION:**Pianist Larry Vuchovich with Special Guest Star Vocalist Jac
 kie Ryan**\n\n**Larry Vuckovich** is a **Yugoslavian-born American jazz pi
 anist** acclaimed for his eclectic style blending bop\, post-bop\, blues\,
  and world music. Classically trained in Kotor\, he emigrated to San Franc
 isco in 1951\, studied with Vince Guaraldi\, and performed with legends li
 ke Mel Tormé\, Jon Hendricks\, Philly Joe Jones\, and Dexter Gordon. A fi
 xture at top US and European jazz venues\, he leads ensembles such as Blue
  Balkan and has been honored with multiple lifetime achievement awards.
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theater
URL:http://www.sonomavalleyjazzsociety.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
