DESCRIPTION:Join St. Supéry for Sip & Swirl Sundays. Sommelier Jamie Jami
 son will host a series of fun and education wine classes that delve into w
 ine tasting key points\, wine and food pairing techniques\, and how to rea
 d a wine label. Offered the first Sunday of each month in 2026. Impress yo
 ur family and friends with new wine knowledge or refresh your wine basics 
 during these convivial tasting seminars hosted in the heart of Napa Valley
 . Wine Club members receive a 50% discount on tickets. Space is limited. R
