BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Camden Files - book  launch and signing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T160000
UID:261103XIVD34fcAkCLb7MNVeem5w
DESCRIPTION:The Camden Files book launch tour is underway! Join author Can
 dice Camden at these upcoming local events for book presentations & exclus
 ive signings.\n\nThis gripping legal thriller chronicles the 55-year caree
 r of a legendary defense attorney\, Stephen Camden\, as he navigates som
 e of the darkest intersections of California’s justice system. From repr
 esenting high-profile murderers and notorious inmates\, like Charles Manso
 n\, to surviving his own public brush with the law. It is the story of a
  man who spent a lifetime defending the indefensible.\n\nEVENT 1: Book Pre
 sentation & Signing\n\nWhen: Thursday\, November 12th | 6:00 PM – 7:30 P
 M\n\nWhere: Vallejo John F. Kennedy Library \\(Joseph Room\\) — 505 Sant
 a Clara St\, Vallejo\n\nWhat: Pull back the curtain on one of Solano Count
 y’s most enigmatic legal figures. Sponsored by the Vallejo JFK Library.\
 n\nEVENT 2: Chris’ Club Book Party & Signing\n\nWhen: Thursday\, Novembe
 r 19th | 7:30 PM – 9:00 PM\n\nWhere: Chris’ Club — 656 Benicia Rd\, 
 Vallejo\n\nWhat: Meet the man himself\, Stephen Camden! Come for the book 
 signing\, Live Blues Music and Grill-Your-Own Steak Night!\n\nEVENT 3: Hol
 iday Book Sale Event\n\nWhen: Saturday\, December 5th | 4:00 PM\n\nWhere: 
 Studio 54 Cycling & Aerobics — 771 Tuolumne St\, Vallejo\n\nWhat: Grab y
 our copy of the book just in time for the holidays and get it signed!
LOCATION:Studio 54 Cycling & Aerobics
URL:https://www.camdenfiles.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
