 tati Ave. and Charles St. The street becomes alive with holiday goodness i
 ncluding local artisans and businesses\, delicious local food\, live music
 \, and Santa Clause!\n\nBring the family to play our fun passport bingo an
 d win prizes! Join the amazing Marble Races at Hines Signs! Stones Throw G
 ifts will have their annual holiday sales event that will expand into thei
 r parking lot \\(weather permitting\\). Mark your calendars so you don't m
 iss out on the fun! Thank you to our sponsors City of Cotati\, County of S
 onoma\, Stones Throw Gifts\, Hines Signs\, and Recology.
